# =============================================================
# Root reference — copy each section into the env file noted.
# Real values must NEVER be committed (see .gitignore).
# The per-app .env.example files are the source of truth for exact vars;
# this file is just a quick map of "which vars go where".
# =============================================================

# ---------- apps/web/.env ----------
# See apps/web/.env.example for the full list (Supabase, workspace slug,
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV, optional Sentry).

# ---------- apps/pos-app/.env ----------
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGc...

# ---------- supabase/.env (loaded by `supabase functions serve --env-file ./supabase/.env`) ----------
# See supabase/.env.example for the full list (Supabase, APP_ENV, Xendit,
# Resend, optional Sentry).
